      65	| `fact:2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration:alpha1-algebra-balance` | verified | `verification/results/verify-20260619T180514214437Z-fact-alpha-1-pec-balance-and-shifted-mag.json` |
      66	| `fact:2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration:edge-pml-linear-obstruction` | verified | `verification/results/verify-20260619T181255226823Z-fact-the-alpha-1-source-model-has-exact-.json` |
      67	| `fact:2d_maxwell_pml_energy_functional_exploration:augmented-gronwall-energy` | verified | `verification/results/verify-20260619T181650715321Z-fact-a-positive-augmented-zeroth-order-e.json` |
