     295	
     296	### 5.2 CFS/ADE generalized stretched PML
     297	
     298	取更一般的 rational stretch
     299	\[
     300	S_i(s)=\kappa_i+\frac{\sigma_i}{s+\alpha_i},\qquad
     301	\kappa_i\ge1,\quad \sigma_i\ge0,\quad \alpha_i\ge0.
     302	\]
